# Content pipeline (MD → JSON)

## Sources (whitelist, project root)

| MD | Route |
|----|-------|
| `main.md` | `/` (home sections) |
| `Resorts.md` | `/resorts` |
| `Casino Games.md` | `/casino-games` |
| `Rewards Program.md` | `/rewards-program` |
| `app.md` | `/app` |
| `Rules and Payouts.md` | `/rules-and-payouts` |
| `FAQ.md` | `/faq` |
| `terms.md` | `/terms` |
| `privacy.md` | `/privacy` |

`README.md` is **not** parsed.

## Workflow

1. Edit the relevant `*.md` in the project root.
2. Run `yarn sync:content` (or `yarn sync` for content + theme).
3. Commit both MD and generated `src/app/data/*.json`.

**Do not** hand-edit `src/app/data/*.json` — they are generated.

## Output layout

```
src/app/data/siteMeta.json
src/app/data/dataCasinoIntro.json
src/app/data/dataCasinoInfo.json
src/app/data/dataApp.json
src/app/data/dataAfterSupport.json
src/app/data/dataSupport.json
src/app/data/dataAfterFaq.json
src/app/data/dataFaq.json
src/app/data/dataLast.json
src/app/data/dataFooter.json
src/app/data/pages/{slug}.json
```

## Home section map (`main.md` → JSON → component)

| `##` in main.md | JSON file | Component |
|-----------------|-----------|-----------|
| preamble (`# H1` + paragraph) | `siteMeta.json` + `dataCasinoIntro.json` | BonusSection + CasinoIntroSection (`h1`, `title`; intro in `content`) |
| Where It All Started | `dataLast.json` | LastSection |
| What Makes the Resorts Different | `dataSupport.json` | SupportSection (intro + table) |
| What Sets the Online Platform Apart | `dataCasinoInfo.json` | CasinoInfoSection |
| Who Should Visit and Who Should Skip | `dataAfterFaq.json` | InfoSectionAfterFaq (intro + `###` as tabs) |
| FAQ | `dataFaq.json` | FaqSection |

`dataFooter.json` ← `ogSiteName` from `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_NAME`, fallback: Title text before `:` or ` - `.

